# Kieran van der Heijde

> Python Engineer at ASML in Veldhoven, the Netherlands. Builds PeekSeek, AlgoStudio and Angelo with Python, FastAPI and Rust.

Kieran works mostly in Python with Flask and FastAPI. He built and runs PeekSeek, a competitive matchmaking platform for the game Unturned, and AlgoStudio, a platform for teaching programming with sandboxed Python and C#. He is open to Python and software roles across the Netherlands.

## Projects

- [Angelo]({{ site }}/#projects): Python mutation testing, about 10 times faster; calculates the score within 4.5 seconds. Docs: https://angelo.kcvdh.com, source: https://github.com/kvandeh/Angelo
- [PeekSeek](https://peekseek.net): Ranked matchmaking and automated events for Unturned, played by over 2,500 users. Source: https://github.com/PeekSeek/PeekSeek
- [AlgoStudio]({{ site }}/articles/algostudio-sandbox/): A programming education platform built with teachers from 3 applied universities in the Netherlands; runs student code in Docker.
- [Bouncer](https://github.com/kvandeh/Bouncer): A language-model filter for Spotify Jam requests that did not hold up at real parties.

